# Services
# Core offline application services & background engines:
# - mesh_service.dart: Flooding + deduplication mesh relay engine
# - discovery_service.dart: P2P device discovery (Nearby Connections / BLE / Wi-Fi Direct)
# - battery_discipline_service.dart: Throttles discovery frequency & priorities based on battery level
# - location_service.dart: On-demand one-shot GPS coordinate fetcher for SOS packets
# - cloud_sync_service.dart: Lightweight HTTP client that uploads queued data when internet reconnects
